{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262PNBzU1B1f1792836266.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>強烈熱帶風暴薔琵為日本沖繩帶來暴雨。</p><p></p><p>沖繩縣靠近台灣的石垣島，橫風橫雨，有樹木和路牌倒塌在路面。上午縣內電力供應中斷，約1.3萬戶受影響。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON 1300 NHK.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TZCT1WWOWZ1792829832.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>石垣空港和川平等地過去48小時錄得逾300毫米雨量，西表島降雨量更高達567毫米。氣象廳預計，強降雨將持續到周二，提醒民眾防範巨浪、山泥傾瀉，和低漥地區洪水等災害，避免不必要的外出。</p><p></p><p>受風暴影響，全日空和日本航空周六共取消35班機，主要往返沖繩縣和鹿兒島偏遠島嶼的航班。航空公司表示，可能有更多航班取消和延誤，呼籲乘客留意最新資訊。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:42:13.459220+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T21:18:07.392906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:47.733709+00:00","content_hash":"6bf90c4ad02e293a362f973235b2b793514d9e0cce69be1786c07ec78ca8a1b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}